hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1669","[AI-translation] Ata se, Safwan bin Ya'la bin Umayyah se, Ya'la bin Umayyah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghazwa mein shirkat ki. Ata ne kaha: Ya'la kahte the: Woh ghazwa mere khayal mein mere doosre a'mal ki nisbat zyada qabil bharosa tha. Ata ne kaha: Safwan ne kaha: Ya'la ne kaha: Mera ek mazdoor tha, woh ek insan se lad pada, in mein se ek ne doosre ke hath par dant se kata, jis ka hath kata ja raha tha us ne katne wale ke munh se apne hath ko khaincha to us ke samne wale danton mein se ek dant toot gaya. Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne us ke agle dant ko raigan bana diya. Ata ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya woh apna hath tere munh mein chhor deta ke tu use aise chaba jata jaise oont apne munh mein chabata hai?' Ata ne kaha: Mujhe Safwan ne bataya tha ke kis ne dant se kata tha lekin main bhool gaya hun."
"1670","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke un ke walid ne unhen khabar di ke ek insan Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya, aur is ko ek doosre insan ne dant se kata to us ne apna hath is se khaincha ke is ka ek samne ka dant gir gaya, to Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Is ka samne ka dant zae chala gaya."
"1671","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar koi shakhs tere ghar mein baghair ijazat ke jhanke aur tum use kankri mar do jis se is ki aankh phoot jae to tum par koi gunah nahin.'"
"1672","[AI-translation] Zuhri ne kaha: Main ne Sahl bin Sa'd ko kahte suna: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kisi hujre mein surakh se dekha, us waqt Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek kangha tha jis se sar mubarak khuja rahe the, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe maloom hota ke tum jhank rahe ho to main yahi kangha teri aankh mein chobha deta, kyunke ijazat ka mutalba to dekhne ki wajah se hai.'"
"1673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghar mein tashreef farma the ke ek aadmi ko dekha jis ne Aap ko jhanka tha, to Aap ne is ki taraf teer ka phal jhukaya jo Aap ke hath mein tha, goya ke agar woh peeche na hatta to Aap ko is baat ki koi parwah na thi ke is phal se is ki aankh chubh jati."
"1674","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah se riwayat hai, unhon ne aur in ki qaum ke bade logon ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Sahl bin Abi Hathmah aur Muhayyisah donon Khaibar ki taraf mali mushkilat ki wajah se gae. Jab woh donon apni apni zarooriyat ke liye alag hue to Muhayyisah ko khabar aai ke Abdullah bin Sahl to qatl kar diye gae hain aur unhen ek knwen ya chashme ke paas phaink diya gaya hai. Muhayyisah Yahudiyon ke paas aae aur in se kaha Allah ki qasam! Tum hi logon ne unhen qatl kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha, Allah ki qasam! Ham ne unhen nahin mara. Phir Muhayyisah apni qaum walon ke paas aae aur unhen yeh waqea sunaya. Phir woh aur in ke bade bhai Huwayyisah aur maqtool ke bhai Abdur Rahman bin Sahl Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae. Muhayyisah chunkay Khaibar mein is waqt maujood the is liye unhon ne guftagu shuru kar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhayyisah se farmaya: 'Bade ko baat karne do' yani jo umr mein bada hai. Phir Huwayyisah ne baat ki baad mein Muhayyisah ne baat ki, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ya to woh tumhare sathi ki diyat den aur ya phir unhen jang ka notice diya jae.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen is muqadma ke silsila mein likha, to unhon ne jawab mein likha, Allah ki qasam! Ham ne unhen qatl nahin kiya. Is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Huwayyisah, Muhayyisah aur Abdur Rahman se kaha: 'Tum qasam khao to tumhare sathi ka khoon in par sabit ho jaega.' Unhon ne kaha, ham qasam nahin khate. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir Yahudi qasam khaenge.' Unhon ne kaha, woh to Musalman nahin hain. Aakhir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne paas se Abdullah ki diyat mein sau oontniyan unhen de deen. Yahan tak ke yeh oontniyan in ke ghar pahuncha di gaen. Sahl ne kaha, in mein se ek surkh oontni ne mujhe laat de mari thi."
"1675","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abu Hathmah se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisah bin Mas'ud Khaibar ki taraf gae, phir donon apni zarooriyat ke liye alag alag ho gae ke Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae. Phir Muhayyisah, maqtool ka bhai Abdur Rahman aur Huwayyisah bin Mas'ud Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chale aae, unhon ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Abdullah bin Sahl ke qatl ka waqea bayan kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum pachaas qasmen khao aur apne maqtool ya apne sathi ki diyat ke mustahiq ho jaoge.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Ham to is waqt wahan maujood na the.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir Yahud pachaas qasmon se tum se chhutkara pa lenge.' Unhon ne arz kiya: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Ham kafir qaum ki qasmon ko kaise qabool karen.' Us ne khayal kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ki diyat apni taraf se ada kar di. Basheer bin Yasar ne kaha ke Sahl ne farmaya, mujhe in diyat ke oonton mein se ek oontni ne thaan mein laat de mari."
"1676","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abu Hathmah aur in ki qaum ke bade logon ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Huwayyisah, Muhayyisah aur Abdur Rahman se kaha: 'Tum qasmen do ge to apne sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq thahro ge.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin'. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir Yahud qasam khaenge.'"
"1677","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ibtida Ansariyon se ki jab unhon ne qasmen na uthain to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasmon ko Yahudiyon par lauta diya."
"1678","[AI-translation] Ek aur sanad se Basheer bin Yasar ke wasta se Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sabiqa hadees ki misl marvi hai."
"1679","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Banu Sa'd bin Laith mein se ek aadmi ne ghoda daudaya aur Juhainah qabile ke ek aadmi ki ek ungli kuchli di, is mein khoon jari hua aur woh aadmi faut ho gaya. Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ungli kuchalne wale ki qaum se kaha: 'Tum pachaas qasmen khate ho ke woh aadmi ungli kuchalne se nahin mara?' To unhon ne qasmen khane se inkar kar diya. Phir doosron se kaha: 'Tum qasmen khao' to unhon ne bhi inkar kar diya aur woh qasmen khane se ruk gae."
